{"id":"en_highway-chase-with-the-runaway-heiress","title":"Highway Chase with the Runaway Heiress","titleEn":"Highway Chase with the Runaway Heiress","description":"Russell Green, a former military man now driving a taxi, is rushing to reach his injured brother when Diana White, an heiress on the run, hires him to help her get away from a merciless fiancé. What begins as a simple arrangement turns into a fight for survival as the pair are pursued across Nevada by mobsters, snipers, killers, poachers, bears and even avalanches. As Russell struggles to keep Diana alive, their deal deepens into love, and he eventually discovers that his brother's crash was not an accident. Dramzio is a place where this series can be followed.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/highway-chase-with-the-runaway-heiress/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/highway-chase-with-the-runaway-heiress/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Karma","Karma Payback","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkq2w/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_highway-chase-with-the-runaway-heiress_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkq2w/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_highway-chase-with-the-runaway-heiress_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkq2w/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_highway-chase-with-the-runaway-heiress_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkq2w/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_highway-chase-with-the-runaway-